# Wave 3 — the shared seams the information screens asked for, landed

Tickets this wave serves: UIR-11 (stat strip), UIR-13 (help), UIR-14 (history),
UIR-15 (challenges), UIR-16 (profile). The lanes it touches: theme, data, focus — the
three the four screens' own logs recorded as seams, plus the two red lines the router
scan saw in them.

What this wave does **not** touch: the frozen reference (`js/`, `styles.css`), the sim,
the saves, the locale tables, the modes, and the input lane's own files
(`src/input/menu_nav.gd`, `src/input/focus_nav.gd`, `game/menu_focus.gd`). No file was
staged, committed, or deleted; no worker was spawned; the round's spend is $0.

Route taken on the engine: this lane has none. Every check below is static, and the
exact engine commands are in §7 for the worker who owns the runner.

---

